# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Local builds (make build)
/bin/

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum
*.db

# Key material and SQLite side files that hold database pages (SEC-003)
*.ckey
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Generated for release archives by scripts/third-party-licenses.sh (Q-006)
/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt

# env file
.env

# Personal Claude Code settings and notes (CLAUDE.md and the rest of .claude/ are shared)
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md

# Editor/IDE
# .idea/
# .vscode/
